OL,3,GNEWSABike hub applies for alcohol and
OL,4,Amusic licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe and bike hire business in the
OL,7,FNorth York Moors has applied for a
OL,8,Flicence to sell alcohol and play music
OL,9,F- dividing the opinions of local
OL,10,Fresidents.
OL,12,FIf approved, Bike Base North York Moors
OL,13,FLtd on Dikes Lane in Great Ayton would
OL,14,Fbe allowed to host live music and have
OL,15,Fspace for dancing indoors and outdoors,
OL,16,Ffrom 10:00 until 20:00 seven days a
OL,17,Fweek.
OL,19,FNorth Yorkshire Council has received 25
OL,20,Fobjections to the proposals, alongside
OL,21,F49 letters of support.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
