OL,3,GNEWSABike hub applies for alcohol and
OL,4,Amusic licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club argued the proposed 20:00
OL,7,Ffinish was within "sociable hours" and
OL,8,Fdescribed the site as "not a party
OL,9,Fvenue", but somewhere people could
OL,10,Frelax in the countryside.
